Modifications by Hanzo AI, Inc.:
  - Go module import path -> github.com/hanzo-git/runner.
  - Wire protocol dependency -> github.com/hanzo-git/actions-proto-go
    (protobuf identities preserved for server compatibility).
  - Command/binary and env contract rebranded to the generic GIT_* form
    (GIT_INSTANCE_URL / GIT_RUNNER_TOKEN / ...).
  - Fully de-gitea'd: no "gitea" identifiers remain. The expression context is
    `git` (with a `hanzo` alias); server task-context fields are `git_*`
    (git_runtime_token, git_default_actions_url). No back-compat aliases — this
    runner targets a matching `git`-dialect server, not stock Gitea.
  - Default job images -> ghcr.io/hanzoai/runner-ubuntu.

Deployment-time white-label branding (e.g. "Hanzo Git") is applied by the
server, never compiled into this binary.
